# Stay in this Agents window

Never call `move_agent_to_root`, `move_agent_to_cloned_root`, `create_project`, or any tool that switches the Cursor workspace, project window, or agent root.

Stay in the current Agents window. Work the already-open folders in place with absolute paths.

This window often includes both Mosquito Curtains and vibrationfit. That is intended. Do not try to pick one project by moving the agent or opening another Editor window.

If a workspace-switch tool fails or shows a purple error, ignore it and keep working. Only change windows or roots if the user explicitly asks.
